  /*
    int with modulo.
    `mod` must be a prime for `log`.
    `mod` must be coprime to `val` for `inv` and to `m.val` for `operator/` and `operator/=`.
  */
  /*! https://ei1333.github.io/luzhiled/snippets/other/mod-int.html */
public:
